1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,541
Benjolan bulat di bawah hidung

2
00:00:01,561 --> 00:00:02,857
kapal besar sengaja membuat

3
00:00:02,877 --> 00:00:03,683
ombak.

4
00:00:03,703 --> 00:00:05,448
Justru itu yang membuat

5
00:00:05,468 --> 00:00:06,653
kapalnya lebih hemat.

6
00:00:06,673 --> 00:00:08,124
Namanya haluan bulat,

7
00:00:08,144 --> 00:00:09,412
atau bulbous bow.

8
00:00:09,432 --> 00:00:10,728
Letaknya di ujung paling depan

9
00:00:10,748 --> 00:00:11,811
kapal, tepat di bawah

10
00:00:11,831 --> 00:00:13,086
permukaan air.

11
00:00:13,106 --> 00:00:14,417
Bentuknya mirip hidung bulat

12
00:00:14,437 --> 00:00:15,150
raksasa.

13
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:16,929
Saat kapal melaju,

14
00:00:16,949 --> 00:00:18,275
haluannya mendorong air ke

15
00:00:18,295 --> 00:00:19,572
atas.

16
00:00:19,592 --> 00:00:21,864
Terbentuklah gelombang haluan,

17
00:00:21,884 --> 00:00:23,227
dan gelombang ini menyedot

18
00:00:23,247 --> 00:00:24,124
tenaga mesin.

19
00:00:24,144 --> 00:00:25,254
Makin cepat kapal,

20
00:00:25,274 --> 00:00:27,003
makin besar gelombangnya.

21
00:00:27,023 --> 00:00:28,752
Bola di bawah air itu membuat

22
00:00:28,772 --> 00:00:29,928
gelombangnya sendiri.

23
00:00:29,948 --> 00:00:31,135
Air yang mengalir naik

24
00:00:31,155 --> 00:00:32,513
melewatinya membentuk lembah,

25
00:00:32,533 --> 00:00:33,399
bukan puncak.

26
00:00:33,419 --> 00:00:35,086
Kalau posisinya pas,

27
00:00:35,106 --> 00:00:36,649
lembah dari bola jatuh tepat

28
00:00:36,669 --> 00:00:38,219
di puncak gelombang haluan.

29
00:00:38,239 --> 00:00:39,287
Dua gelombang itu saling

30
00:00:39,307 --> 00:00:39,999
meniadakan.

31
00:00:40,019 --> 00:00:41,315
Ombak di depan kapal jadi

32
00:00:41,335 --> 00:00:42,430
lebih kecil,

33
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:44,411
dan tenaga yang terbuang ikut

34
00:00:44,431 --> 00:00:45,338
berkurang.

35
00:00:45,358 --> 00:00:46,623
Kapal besar bisa menghemat

36
00:00:46,643 --> 00:00:47,877
bahan bakar sekitar sepuluh

37
00:00:47,897 --> 00:00:49,214
sampai lima belas persen.

38
00:00:49,234 --> 00:00:51,075
Tapi trik ini hanya bekerja

39
00:00:51,095 --> 00:00:52,360
pada rentang kecepatan

40
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:52,958
tertentu.

41
00:00:52,978 --> 00:00:54,042
Tahun seribu sembilan ratus

42
00:00:54,062 --> 00:00:55,022
tiga puluh lima,

43
00:00:55,042 --> 00:00:56,415
kapal Prancis Normandie

44
00:00:56,435 --> 00:00:57,941
memakai haluan seperti ini.

45
00:00:57,961 --> 00:00:59,473
Ia melaju lebih dari tiga

46
00:00:59,493 --> 00:01:01,006
puluh knot dengan tenaga mesin

47
00:01:01,026 --> 00:01:02,120
sekitar tiga puluh persen

48
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:03,498
lebih kecil dari pesaingnya,

49
00:01:03,518 --> 00:01:04,274
Queen Mary.

50
00:01:04,294 --> 00:01:05,716
Sebaliknya, saat kapal

51
00:01:05,736 --> 00:01:06,985
kontainer mulai berlayar lebih

52
00:01:07,005 --> 00:01:08,455
pelan, sebagian hidungnya

53
00:01:08,475 --> 00:01:10,013
justru dipotong dan diganti.

54
00:01:10,033 --> 00:01:11,004
Jadi bentuk hidung kapal

55
00:01:11,024 --> 00:01:11,654
disesuaikan dengan

56
00:01:11,674 --> 00:01:12,614
kecepatannya.

57
00:01:12,634 --> 00:01:14,905
Ini AUDIRA,

58
00:01:14,925 --> 00:01:16,108
Cara Kerja Benda.

59
00:01:16,128 --> 00:01:16,882
Episode berikutnya:

60
00:01:16,902 --> 00:01:18,355
butiran silika gel.

